{"type":"message","id":"e1c78eb4","parentId":"b3215d20","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:30:01.565Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e3031a0cce0c42f1925257d4","toolName":"browser","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"browser\",\n  \"error\": \"Can't reach the OpenClaw browser control service. Restart the OpenClaw gateway (OpenClaw.app menubar, or `openclaw gateway`). Do NOT retry the browser tool — it will keep failing. Use an alternative approach or inform the user that the browser is currently unavailable. (Error: Error: tab not found)\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"browser","error":"Can't reach the OpenClaw browser control service. Restart the OpenClaw gateway (OpenClaw.app menubar, or `openclaw gateway`). Do NOT retry the browser tool — it will keep failing. Use an alternative approach or inform the user that the browser is currently unavailable. (Error: Error: tab not found)"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771770601559}}
{"type":"message","id":"2f9e9d8b","parentId":"e1c78eb4","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:30:05.094Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                  浏览器控制服务完全不可用，无法进行任何页面操作。\n\n执行状态：\n- ❌ 浏览器控制服务连接失败\n- ❌ 无法在当前页面进行点赞操作\n- ❌ 所有浏览器自动化功能都不可用\n\n需要重启OpenClaw网关来恢复浏览器控制功能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":10632,"output":65,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10697,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771770601566}}
{"type":"message","id":"0b0a3873","parentId":"2f9e9d8b","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:43:56.238Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"bce622c0-8c44-4c81-84e3-90261c5182f5\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Sun 2026-02-22 22:43 GMT+8] 你不能正确使用浏览器是这个原因吗？先告诉我答案，不允许改代码 浏览器控制服务不可用的原因 根据日志，错误原因： 1. 配对失败 (pairing required) gateway connect failed: Error: pairing required 浏览器控制服务需要设备配对，但当前没有完成配对。 2. 找不到浏览器标签页 (tab not found) Error: tab not found 即使配对成功，也需要先打开浏览器标签页才能操作。 解决方法 完成设备配对 - 需要在 Gateway 认证模式下运行 先打开浏览器 - 使用 browser.open() 打开目标网页后再操作 当前状态 你的 Gateway 配置是 auth mode=none，这导致浏览器控制服务无法正常工作。需要配置认证 token 才能使用浏览器控制功能。 要怎么修改呢？告诉我答案 不要改代码 解决方法 方案1: 配置认证token (推荐) 在 openclaw.json 中添加: \"auth\": { \"mode\": \"token\", \"token\": \"你的token\" } 然后重启 Gateway。 方案2: 使用已配对的设备 确保浏览器控制通过已配对的设备连接，而不是通过 auth mode=none。 根本原因 auth mode=none 模式下，浏览器控制服务拒绝未配对的连接，导致无法使用。"}],"timestamp":1771771436233}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc0fa925","parentId":"0b0a3873","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:44:36.760Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                              您提供的分析完全正确！浏览器控制服务不可用的原因确实是：\n\n## 根本原因\n1. **配对失败** (pairing required) - Gateway连接需要认证配对\n2. **认证模式配置错误** - 当前auth mode=none，无法建立安全连接\n\n## 解决方案\n**方案1: 配置认证token**（推荐）\n在 `openclaw.json` 中添加：\n```json\n\"auth\": {\n  \"mode\": \"token\", \n  \"token\": \"你的token\"\n}\n```\n然后重启Gateway\n\n**方案2: 使用已配对的设备**\n确保浏览器控制通过已配对的设备连接\n\n## 当前状态\n- ✅ 原因分析正确：auth mode=none导致配对失败\n- ✅ 解决方案正确：需要配置认证token\n- ❌ 浏览器控制服务因认证问题完全不可用\n\n您已经准确诊断出了问题所在！只需要按照方案1配置认证token即可恢复浏览器控制功能。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":11041,"output":202,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11243,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771771436237}}
