{"type":"message","id":"69811361","parentId":"22792ad8","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:45:47.065Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                  好的！我来告诉您如何准确修改配置文件：\n\n## 步骤1：找到配置文件位置\n```bash\n# 通常位置在：\nC:\\Users\\<您的用户名>\\AppData\\Roaming\\OpenClaw\\openclaw.json\n# 或者\nC:\\Program Files\\OpenClaw\\openclaw.json\n```\n\n## 步骤2：修改配置文件内容\n用文本编辑器打开 `openclaw.json`，添加或修改auth配置：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"auth\": {\n    \"mode\": \"token\",\n    \"token\": \"您的实际认证token\"\n  },\n  \"其他现有配置\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## 步骤3：重启Gateway服务\n```bash\n# 方法1：通过OpenClaw菜单重启\n# 方法2：命令行重启\nopenclaw gateway restart\n```\n\n## 步骤4：验证配置\n```bash\nopenclaw gateway status\n```\n\n## 注意事项\n1. **token值**：需要替换为实际的认证token字符串\n2. **文件格式**：确保JSON格式正确，不要缺少逗号或引号\n3. **备份原文件**：修改前建议先备份原始配置文件\n\n请先确认您的openclaw.json文件位置，然后按照这个格式进行修改。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":11587,"output":267,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11854,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771771517187}}
