{"type":"message","id":"ed9544f9","parentId":"92909aaa","timestamp":"2026-02-22T14:46:11.606Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                              我无法知道您的实际认证token是什么。token通常是：\n\n## token的来源\n1. **系统生成**：OpenClaw安装时自动生成\n2. **配置文件查看**：可能在现有的配置文件中\n3. **环境变量**：可能设置在系统环境变量中\n\n## 如何查找您的token\n1. **检查现有配置文件**：\n```bash\n# 查看当前openclaw.json是否有token\ntype C:\\Users\\%USERNAME%\\AppData\\Roaming\\OpenClaw\\openclaw.json\n```\n\n2. **查看环境变量**：\n```bash\n# 检查是否有相关环境变量\necho %OPENCLAW_TOKEN%\n```\n\n3. **重新生成**：如果找不到，可能需要重新安装或重新生成token\n\n## 如果没有token怎么办\n如果确实没有token，您可能需要：\n1. 重新安装OpenClaw\n2. 联系OpenClaw支持获取帮助\n3. 查看文档中关于token生成的部分\n\n请先检查现有的配置文件，看看是否已经有token配置。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":11937,"output":216,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12153,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771771554589}}
