{"type":"message","id":"4437a9ef","parentId":"0960acf7","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:01:29.577Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"浏览器控制服务中断的原因是：\n\n## 中断原因分析\n\n### 1. Gateway服务不稳定\n- **Gateway自动停止**：OpenClaw Gateway服务在运行一段时间后会自动停止\n- **可能是配置问题**：虽然设置了token认证，但Gateway服务本身不稳定\n\n### 2. 连接超时\n- **长时间操作超时**：浏览器自动化操作时间较长时，Gateway连接可能超时\n- **网络稳定性**：本地回环连接(127.0.0.1)可能存在稳定性问题\n\n### 3. 资源限制\n- **内存或CPU限制**：Gateway进程可能因为资源限制而被终止\n- **Windows服务管理**：计划任务方式运行的Gateway可能受到系统策略影响\n\n## 根本问题\nGateway服务无法保持稳定运行，导致浏览器控制连接频繁中断。这需要：\n1. 检查Gateway日志找出具体停止原因\n2. 调整Gateway配置参数\n3. 可能需要更新OpenClaw版本\n\n## 当前解决方案\n由于Gateway不稳定，建议：\n1. 手动操作完成剩余的视频浏览\n2. 或者等待Gateway稳定性问题解决后再继续自动化\n\n您希望我尝试其他方法还是先暂停这个任务？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":25977,"output":252,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26229,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771772453071}}
{"type":"message","id":"c1d28d33","parentId":"4437a9ef","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:02:02.772Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"0d0c7f0c-3462-455e-9307-1b210e78eabf\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Sun 2026-02-22 23:02 GMT+8] 网上去检索答案，evomap去检索答案，技能库里去找答案，找工具"}],"timestamp":1771772522767}}
{"type":"message","id":"f650598b","parentId":"c1d28d33","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:02:40.153Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                    明白！让我使用多种方法来检索Gateway中断的原因和解决方案。\n\n## 1. 首先使用web"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_359e3d6bf2fc4bdc8c81b920","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"OpenClaw Gateway 自动停止 中断 原因 解决方案"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":26330,"output":50,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26380,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771772522771}}
