        │ to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to    │                        │\n│           │                  │ latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill  │                        │\n│           │                  │ folders with the npm-installed clawdhub CLI.                │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 cron-scheduler │ Schedule and manage periodic tasks using cron-like          │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ scheduling                                                  │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 find-skills    │ Helps users discover and install agent skills when they     │ agents-skills-personal │\n│           │                  │ ask questions like \"how do I do X\", \"find a skill for X\",   │                        │\n│           │                  │ \"is there a skill that can...\", or express interest in      │                        │\n│           │                  │ extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the  │                        │\n│           │                  │ user is looking for functionality that might exist as an    │                        │\n│           │                  │ installable skill.                                          │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 frontend-      │ Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces    │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │ design           │ with high design quality. Use this skill when the user      │                        │\n│           │                  │ asks to build web components, pages, or applications.       │                        │\n│           │                  │ Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI    │                        │\n│           │                  │ aesthetics.                                                 │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 humanizer      │ Remove signs of AI-generated writing from text. 