{"type":"message","id":"bb003a0c","parentId":"8cce51f8","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:06:07.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                太好了！doctor命令给出了明确的诊断结果：\n\n## 中断原因分析（来自openclaw doctor）\n\n### 1. **端口冲突**\n- **端口18789已被占用**：pid 20544的node.exe进程正在使用该端口\n- **Gateway无法启动**：因为端口已被占用\n\n### 2. **进程锁定**\n- **会话锁文件存在**：`~\\.openclaw\\agents\\main\\sessions\\4ae376a0-1027-439a-afee-eb7ae8256900.js.onl.lock`\n- **pid=20544仍然存活**：已经运行了3分9秒\n\n### 3. **认证问题**\n- **gateway connect failed: Error: pairing required**：虽然配置了token，但仍然需要配对\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 立即修复\n```bash\n# 停止占用端口的进程\ntaskkill /f /pid 20544\n\n# 清理锁文件\ndel ~\\.openclaw\\agents\\main\\sessions\\4ae376a0-1027-439a-afee-eb7ae8256900.js.onl.lock\n\n# 重启Gateway\nopenclaw gateway start\n```\n\n### 长期解决方案\n1. **检查端口冲突原因**：为什么会有其他node进程占用18789端口\n2. **完善配对流程**：确保浏览器扩展和Gateway完成完整配对\n3. **监控Gateway稳定性**：设置自动重启机制\n\n您希望我立即执行修复操作吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":34687,"output":323,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35010,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771772719048}}
