{"type":"message","id":"d238f6af","parentId":"0850ec3d","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:24:05.965Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            PowerShell语法有问题。让我创建一个批处理文件"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c6ad0ae035bd4f69acfea2d6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\lenovo\\.openclaw\\gateway-fix.bat","content":"@echo off\necho 正在修复OpenClaw Gateway...\n\nREM 清理端口占用\nfor /f \"tokens=5\" %%a in ('netstat -ano ^| findstr \":18789\" ^| findstr \"LISTENING\"') do (\n    if not \"%%a\"==\"0\" (\n        taskkill /f /pid %%a >nul 2>&1\n        echo 已终止进程 PID: %%a\n    )\n)\n\nREM 清理锁文件\ndel /f /q \"%USERPROFILE%\\.openclaw\\agents\\main\\sessions\\*.js.onl.lock\" >nul 2>&1\necho 已清理锁文件\n\nREM 启动Gateway\nopenclaw gateway start\necho Gateway启动命令已发送\n\nREM 等待启动\ntimeout /t 5 /nobreak >nul\n\nREM 验证状态\nopenclaw gateway status | findstr \"running\" >nul\nif %errorlevel% equ 0 (\n    echo ✅ Gateway启动成功\n) else (\n    echo ❌ Gateway启动失败\n)\n\necho 修复完成"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":42918,"output":309,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43227,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771773814738}}
