{"type":"message","id":"63bd3cea","parentId":"cafb1186","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:32:19.487Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"您说得对！频繁的网络连接中断确实很烦人。让我从根本上解决这个问题：\n\n## 永久性解决方案\n\n### 1. **修改默认端口**\n避免端口冲突的根本方法：\n```bash\n# 修改配置文件使用不同的端口\nopenclaw config set gateway.port 18888\n```\n\n### 2. **禁用自动监控**\n已经禁用了每分钟的监控任务，避免频繁中断\n\n### 3. **优化服务配置**\n```bash\n# 使用更稳定的启动方式\nopenclaw gateway --port 18888 --bind 0.0.0.0\n```\n\n### 4. **检查网络设置**\n确保防火墙和网络设置不会阻断连接\n\n您希望我立即实施这些更改吗？这样应该能解决频繁断网的问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":45878,"output":162,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46040,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771774308016}}
{"type":"message","id":"bebf3171","parentId":"63bd3cea","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:32:28.075Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"d9aa6003-31bc-4cfc-b63a-7973560fb721\",\n  \"sender\": \"openclaw-control-ui\"\n}\n```\n\n[Sun 2026-02-22 23:32 GMT+8] 不准换端口"}],"timestamp":1771774348068}}
{"type":"message","id":"36bc27e6","parentId":"bebf3171","timestamp":"2026-02-22T15:32:59.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"明白！不换端口。让我采用其他方法来永久解决18789端口的稳定性问题：\n\n## 替代解决方案\n\n### 1. **加强端口管理**\n```bash\n# 检查并确保端口独占使用\nnetsh int ipv4 set dynamicport tcp start=20000 num=1000\n```\n\n### 2. **优化服务监控**\n```bash\n# 设置更智能的健康检查，避免频繁重启\nopenclaw cron add --name \"gateway-stable-check\" --cron \"*/5 * * * *\" --system-event \"gateway-health\"\n```\n\n### 3. **改进连接保持**\n```bash\n# 配置TCP保持连接参数\nnetsh int tcp set global keepalivetime=1800000\nnetsh int tcp set global keepaliveinterval=60000\n```\n\n### 4. **资源优化**\n```bash\n# 增加Gateway内存限制防止崩溃\nopenclaw config set gateway.memoryLimit 1024\n```\n\n您希望我实施哪个具体的优化方案？还是需要我先分析当前端口冲突的具体原因？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v3.1","usage":{"input":46121,"output":231,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46352,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1771774348073}}
